<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIGAS KOMERCBANKA OFFERS NEW PHONE SERVICE.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIGAS KOMERCBANKA OFFERS NEW PHONE SERVICE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rigas komercbanka said on Monday that it has launched a new 24-hour telephone banking service.</p>
<p>The service means that clients can call after the end of business at six o'clock, leave a message and a bank worker would answer their questions later, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
